WEBVTT

00:04:58.085 --> 00:05:02.381
The governments of Spain and Scotland
have announced four-day week trials

00:05:02.381 --> 00:05:06.469
in which they'll be subsidizing
the fifth day's pay.

00:05:07.887 --> 00:05:10.598
Now one reason for these successes

00:05:10.598 --> 00:05:12.516
is that with reduced work time,

00:05:12.558 --> 00:05:16.187
each hour typically becomes
more productive.

00:05:16.854 --> 00:05:18.814
Norway and Denmark,

00:05:18.856 --> 00:05:22.651
the two European countries
with the shortest average hours of work

00:05:22.693 --> 00:05:25.613
at about 1,380,

00:05:25.654 --> 00:05:27.907
have outsized productivity.

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:30.576
France and Germany are similar.